        "evidence_id": "E008",
        "passage_id": "P005",
        "quote": "Neither of those holdings stands for the broader proposition that any water on a tiled floor anywhere in a locker room must preclude a claim for negligence because water is \"necessarily incidental\" to the entire locker room's intended use.",
        "statement_status": "court_finding"
      }
